  {
   "group_id": "MG-V02",
   "kind": "verbatim_repeat",
   "speaker": "merchant",
   "text": "米拉：老板，我手里有批货，镇上要是有销路，咱们都有赚头。",
   "primary_ne_id": "NE-E0014",
   "member_ne_ids": [
